  "title": "Karen's Cranberry Apple Sweet Potato Packet",
  "description": "Slices of sweet potatoes, apples, and dried cranberries are baked or grilled in foil with brown sugar, butter, and cinnamon until tender for an easy side dish and no clean up.",
